OL,3,GNEWSASeven fire appliances tackle blaze
OL,4,Anear Petworth
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fire in a building has forced the
OL,7,Fclosure of a road in West Sussex.
OL,9,FWest Sussex Fire and Rescue Service has
OL,10,Fsent six fire engines and an aerial
OL,11,Fladder vehicle to the scene in Egdean,
OL,12,Fnear Petworth.
OL,14,FIt has meant the A283 has been closed
OL,15,Fin both directions.
OL,17,FThere are no details of any casualties.
